      "title": "The DP table",
      "description": "### The DP table\n\n**DSA topic:** 10. 0/1 knapsack (dynamic programming) vs greedy\n\ndp[i][b][s] = max(skip site i, take site i). O(n · B · S). Walking back through the table recovers which sites were chosen."
